{
  "about": "Piggybow's pig mood contract. Every case is one test of the pure mood function. Inputs: picks, plan_minor, entries, the goals' sticky timestamps, now (a UTC instant) and today (the device's local date). Amounts are integer minor units in a 2-digit currency. created_at and the goal timestamps are UTC; local_date and today are the device's local dates. Expected lines are ARB keys; args fill their placeholders. A goal's target_minor, start_minor and status appear only in the cases that are about them (C24, C29, C31); the mood function reads only the sticky timestamps. An entry may carry \"auto\": true when a repeat added it (absent means false); the cases with one (C34, C35) play in the mood function's tests only, since a launch fixture writes entries as the person would.",
  "rules": [
    "This week = entries whose local_date is from this week's Monday to today.",
    "save is met when at least 1 saved entry is this week.",
    "plan is met when plan_minor is set, at least 1 entry is this week, and this week's spends are <= plan_minor.",
    "worth is met when this week's spends have worth_it >= 1 and worth_it >= not_really (not_sure never counts against).",
    "k = met picks, n = all picks. Recent = an entry the person added (no \"auto\": true) whose created_at is strictly less than 72 h before now.",
    "An entry with \"auto\": true was added by a repeat, not the person: it counts in this week's picks like any entry, but never as recent.",
    "A timestamp after now (the phone's clock moved back) has age 0.",
    "1. A band or the goal (of any goal, ended ones included) reached strictly less than 24 h before now -> delighted; the goal line beats any band line; several bands -> the highest band's line.",
    "2. n >= 2 and k = n -> delighted, pigDelightedAll.",
    "3. k >= 1 -> happy, the first met pick in the order save, plan, worth.",
    "4. No entries at all -> calm, pigFirstDay.",
    "5. Recent -> calm: pigCalmMonday on a Monday, else pigCalm1-3.",
    "6. Otherwise -> sleepy, pigSleepy1-3.",
    "Rotation: lines[(dayOfYear - 1) mod 3], dayOfYear 1-based on today."
  ],
  "currency": "USD",
  "cases": [
    {
